                "Never embed secrets in client-side code or commit them to "
                "version control."
            ),
        ),
        Document(
            doc_id="billing-api",
            metadata={
                "source": "docs/billing.md",
                "title": "Billing API Reference",
                "category": "billing",
                "priority": "medium",
                "tags": ["api", "payments", "invoices"],
                "date": "2024-05-10",
            },
            text=(
                "The billing API exposes endpoints for invoices, subscriptions, "
                "and payments.\n"
                "List invoices with GET /v1/invoices; fetch a single invoice with "
